  "title": "Unified 4D LiDAR Panoptic Segmentation Framework",
  "summary": "The paper introduces a training-free framework, Geo-4D, that enables holistic LiDAR perception over long time horizons by leveraging geometric reasoning and addressing the challenges of sparse and noisy radar data. A new Segment Anything model, S4VY, builds on feed-forward 4D visual geometry to achieve accurate instance segmentation in dynamic scenes.",
