      "statement": "S4VY enables instance segmentation in dynamic scenes through feed-forward 4D visual geometry.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Geo-4D and S4VY demonstrate state-of-the-art results in both static and dynamic 4D segmentation.",
